    "title": "Disclaimer",
    "html": "<div class=\"doc-alpha\">🚧 Alpha — desktop or laptop only — not for phones or tablets yet</div>\n<div class=\"notice\"><strong>Reactor Dynamics is an educational simulation —\r\n  not engineering software.</strong> It must never be used to operate, design,\r\n  train for, or make any decision about a real nuclear facility. It is no\r\n  substitute for licensed operator training.</div>\n<h2>1. Educational use &amp; safety disclaimer</h2>\r\n  <p>Reactor Dynamics is a teaching tool with <strong>high-fidelity,\r\n  operator-relevant plant physics</strong> — coupled systems modeled so that\r\n  startups, maneuvers, trips, and failures behave in ways you can reason about\r\n  with real PWR practice. It is <strong>not</strong> a licensing code, a safety\r\n  analysis tool, or a digital twin of any named licensed unit, and it must not\r\n  be treated as one.</p>\r\n  <p>You must <strong>not</strong> rely on this simulator, its operator manuals,\r\n  or any output it produces for the operation, design, maintenance, licensing,\r\n  or safety analysis of any real nuclear plant or other industrial system, nor\r\n  as a substitute for accredited operator training or professional advice.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>2. No warranty</h2>\r\n  <p>Reactor Dynamics is provided <strong>&ldquo;as is,&rdquo; without warranty\r\n  of any kind</strong>, express or implied, including but not limited to the\r\n  warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy,\r\n  and non-infringement. The simulator may contain errors in physics,\r\n  procedures, or behavior, and may be unavailable or change at any time.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>3. Limitation of liability</h2>\r\n  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, the author shall not be liable for\r\n  any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or exemplary\r\n  damages arising out of or relating to your use of, or inability to use,\r\n  Reactor Dynamics — even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Your\r\n  use of the simulator is entirely at your own risk.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>4. No affiliation</h2>\r\n  <p>Reactor Dynamics is an independent project. It is not affiliated with,\r\n  endorsed by, or sponsored by any nuclear utility, reactor vendor, regulatory\r\n  body, or the operators of any real facility. References to <strong>Three Mile\r\n  Island</strong>, <strong>Chernobyl</strong>, <strong>Fukushima</strong>, and\r\n  to reactor designs and vendors are made for historical and educational\r\n  purposes only. All trademarks and plant names are the property of their\r\n  respective owners.</p>"
